00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:47.570
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Good afternoon to the

asr-000518
00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:48.630
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Office of the Vice President.

asr-000519
00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:50.450
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Good afternoon, Paul Yusek Zulaika.

asr-000520
00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:53.650
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yesterday, this committee

asr-000521
00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:55.730
Rep. Roberto Nazal: extended to the Office of the President

asr-000522
00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:56.930
Rep. Roberto Nazal: a long-standing courtesy.

asr-000523
00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:57.030
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you.

asr-000524
00:20:58.170 --> 00:21:28.150
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yesterday this committee extended to the Office of the President a longstanding courtesy, passing its budget without interpellation in recognition of its standing as co-equal branch of government. Today I respectfully ask that this committee extend the same courtesy to the Office of the Vice President. The Vice President is currently facing the weight of impeachment proceedings, a burden already heavy enough on its own. Her budget, moreover, has not grown; it remains modest and unremarkable. In fact, the budget proposal is even lower than the

asr-000525
00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:28.230
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-000526
00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:29.870
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Presenting nothing

asr-000527
00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:32.370
Rep. Roberto Nazal: that would warrant a departure from the courtesy

asr-000528
00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:34.130
Rep. Roberto Nazal: this committee was willing to extend

asr-000529
00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:34.770
Rep. Roberto Nazal: just yesterday.

asr-000530
00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:38.350
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mr. Chairman, this is not a request for special

asr-000531
00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:40.410
Rep. Roberto Nazal: treatment. It is simply a request

asr-000532
00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:41.130
Rep. Roberto Nazal: for consistency.

asr-000533
00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:44.150
Rep. Roberto Nazal: That this committee treat every co-equal branch of

asr-000534
00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:46.270
Rep. Roberto Nazal: government with the same measure of respect

asr-000535
00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:48.230
Rep. Roberto Nazal: and fairness regardless of the

asr-000536
00:21:48.230 --> 00:21:49.490
Rep. Roberto Nazal: circumstances surrounding it.

asr-000537
00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:51.090
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mr. Chairman,

asr-000538
00:21:52.030 --> 00:21:54.210
Rep. Roberto Nazal: after a brief manifestation from members,

asr-000539
00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:56.150
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I move for the termination of the budget

asr-000540
00:21:56.150 --> 00:21:58.150
Rep. Roberto Nazal: briefing of the Office of the Vice President,

asr-000541
00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:00.670
Rep. Roberto Nazal: without prejudice to any questions or

asr-000542
00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:02.610
Rep. Roberto Nazal: clarifications that members may raise

asr-000543
