asr-000544
00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:05.390
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000545
00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:06.050
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair.

asr-000546
00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:06.970
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Mr. Chair.

asr-000547
00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:07.630
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair.

asr-000548
00:22:08.270 --> 00:22:08.830
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Objection.

asr-000549
00:22:09.150 --> 00:22:12.270
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: There's a motion, but it's not yet seconded.

asr-000550
00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:13.830
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Meron bang second?

asr-000551
00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:14.750
Committee participant (seconding member): Second.

