00:22:14.990 --> 00:22:15.470
Committee member: Mr. Chair, I second the motion.

asr-000553
00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:16.790
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Objection.

asr-000554
00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:19.010
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: It's a second, but there's an objection so...

asr-000555
