Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Chair, may I explain my objection?

asr-000556
00:22:25.630 --> 00:22:26.490
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair,

asr-000557
00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:28.830
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: mukhang maling aral yung

asr-000558
00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:32.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hinugot ng kagalang-galang na kasama natin dito

asr-000559
00:22:32.640 --> 00:22:57.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: si Rep. Nazal sa nangyari kahapon. Nilinaw natin kahapon sa ating paliwanag na dapat ibasura na itong inter-parliamentary courtesy lalo na pag-usapin ng budget dahil ang tungkulin natin ng lahat ng nasa gobyerno ay maging transparent

asr-000560
00:22:57.100 --> 00:22:59.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa kung paano ginagamit

asr-000561
00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:01.350
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kung paano ginagamit ang pondo ng taong bayan.

asr-000562
00:23:02.150 --> 00:23:07.670
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya sa halip na sabihin dapat gawing patas

asr-000563
00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:12.370
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: o kung hindi tatanungin ang hindi bubusisiin ang budget ng Office of the President,

asr-000564
00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:18.510
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi na rin bubusisiin ang budget ng Office of the Vice President.

asr-000565
00:23:18.510 --> 00:23:22.050
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano susunod dito? Another co-equal branch is the judiciary.

asr-000566
00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:26.370
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mag-move na rin ba kayo na hindi na rin natin bubulat-latin

asr-000567
00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:30.650
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: o bubusisiin ang budget ng judiciary?

asr-000568
00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:32.630
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi naman nangyayari yun ever.

asr-000569
00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:37.430
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, kailangan itigil na po natin ang practice na ito.

asr-000570
00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:44.430
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Anyway, I am sure handa naman na sagutin ang Office of the Vice President

asr-000571
00:23:44.430 --> 00:23:47.990
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: anumang mga tanong kaugnay sa kanilang budget ngayon.

asr-000572
00:23:47.990 --> 00:23:50.890
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, I object to the motion, Mr. Chair.

asr-000573
00:23:51.210 --> 00:23:55.210
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Okay, there's a motion about manifestation lang yun, Julie.

asr-000574
