asr-000579
00:24:06.650 --> 00:24:10.690
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I will ask the resource persons if they are willing to answer a few questions

asr-000580
00:24:10.690 --> 00:24:15.550
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: and then we will proceed with terminating this briefing.

asr-000581
00:24:16.390 --> 00:24:17.210
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Is that alright, Kong?

asr-000582
00:24:18.830 --> 00:24:24.650
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Is it alright, Atonis Ulayka, if you yield to a few questions regarding the budget?

asr-000583
00:24:24.650 --> 00:24:26.190
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Is it alright?

asr-000584
00:24:26.370 --> 00:24:29.590
