Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: If it is alright, then maybe I'll ask our team colleague to just withdraw the motion for a while

asr-000587
00:24:38.070 --> 00:24:44.270
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: and hold it in abeyance because yung resource persons are willing to answer the question

asr-000588
00:24:44.270 --> 00:24:47.690
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: so that the minority will be satisfied.

asr-000589
