Rep. Roberto Nazal: I'm willing to withhold the motion.

asr-000606
00:25:56.050 --> 00:26:01.790
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But the resource person already acknowledged that they are willing to answer the questions

asr-000607
00:26:01.790 --> 00:26:04.730
