asr-000608
00:26:05.310 --> 00:26:06.370
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: So can we...

asr-000609
00:26:06.370 --> 00:26:10.530
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: In consideration, the questions will be very limited.

asr-000610
00:26:10.530 --> 00:26:16.670
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Can we also recognize our esteemed colleague, Congressman Eresi is here.

asr-000611
00:26:17.050 --> 00:26:17.470
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Thank you.

asr-000612
00:26:17.470 --> 00:26:25.470
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: And first on the list would be our colleague, Repto.

asr-000613
00:26:26.050 --> 00:26:28.890
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tinio, it's your chance.

asr-000614
00:26:29.730 --> 00:26:32.250
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Please confine to the budget proposal.

asr-000615
00:26:34.950 --> 00:26:36.290
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair, opo.

asr-000616
00:26:36.790 --> 00:26:39.690
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Congressman Eresi.

asr-000617
00:26:39.990 --> 00:26:41.070
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Baka hindi nyo narinig yun.

asr-000618
00:26:41.830 --> 00:26:45.630
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Una, gusto ko lang i-manifest sa mga kasama natin sa kongreso na

asr-000619
00:26:45.630 --> 00:26:53.750
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi pwedeng limitahan ng sinuang member ang iba pa sa kung ano ang itatanong.

asr-000620
00:26:54.930 --> 00:26:56.310
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nagre-responuhan tayo dito.

asr-000621
00:26:57.650 --> 00:27:06.410
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At sa budget briefings, tinatanong ang mga questions kaugnay sa budget.

asr-000622
00:27:07.350 --> 00:27:13.750
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero mayroon din mga tanongs regarding policy which are not necessarily or immediately related to the budget.

asr-000623
00:27:14.390 --> 00:27:15.090
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kala ka rin yan.

asr-000624
00:27:15.990 --> 00:27:24.410
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So kaya po, gusto ko lang i-registro na hindi maaari at hindi natin tinatanggap na kondisyon

asr-000625
00:27:24.410 --> 00:27:27.630
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung okay, ang tanong lang ay dito lang sa budget.

asr-000626
00:27:27.650 --> 00:27:35.530
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil kayo mismo, yung mga nagsasabi niya na magkasama tayo sa budget hearing sa ibang mga department,

asr-000627
00:27:35.690 --> 00:27:38.810
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi nyo naman pinapractice yun.

asr-000628
00:27:39.530 --> 00:27:43.170
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So anyway, setting that aside.

asr-000629
00:27:43.850 --> 00:27:45.950
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair, I have my time.

asr-000630
00:27:45.990 --> 00:27:47.410
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Just a point of order, Mr. Chair.

asr-000631
00:27:48.430 --> 00:27:49.630
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because of the manifestation made...

asr-000632
00:27:49.630 --> 00:27:51.310
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Just a while, Cong Tinio.

asr-000633
00:27:52.110 --> 00:27:52.410
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yes.

asr-000634
00:27:52.410 --> 00:27:52.610
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yes.

asr-000635
00:27:54.230 --> 00:27:56.410
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Just because of the manifestation made.

asr-000636
00:27:57.650 --> 00:28:01.970
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi there was a motion to observe parliamentary courtesy.

asr-000637
00:28:02.870 --> 00:28:08.690
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: While we understand the position of the good congressman, kaya nga pumayag tayo eh,

asr-000638
00:28:09.230 --> 00:28:15.530
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: na congressman Nazal agreed to temporary withhold.

asr-000639
00:28:15.690 --> 00:28:17.690
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi pagkaganyan, that we do not observe.

asr-000640
00:28:17.770 --> 00:28:19.870
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: We observed it for the office of the President eh.

asr-000641
00:28:19.870 --> 00:28:26.670
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: If we do not extend the same courtesy, then I will also insist that we just divide the house.

asr-000642
00:28:27.650 --> 00:28:30.170
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair, Mr. Chair.

asr-000643
00:28:30.330 --> 00:28:33.230
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Anyway, Congressman Bong Suntay, ako naman ang timon.

asr-000644
00:28:33.970 --> 00:28:40.310
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: If there is a question that tingin ko na hindi na dapat sagutin dahil nandoon na sa Senado,

asr-000645
00:28:41.790 --> 00:28:43.990
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: and if there is a question outside the budget,

asr-000646
00:28:44.630 --> 00:28:47.510
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: tanungin ko yung mga resource persons kung gusto ba nilang sagutin.

asr-000647
00:28:48.110 --> 00:28:52.110
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Kung sinabi nilang hindi nila pwedeng masagot, then I will also roll against it.

asr-000648
00:28:52.870 --> 00:28:53.330
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Okay ba yan?

asr-000649
00:28:56.060 --> 00:28:57.660
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Mr. Chair, Mr. Chair.

asr-000650
00:28:57.660 --> 00:28:57.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair.

asr-000651
00:28:57.900 --> 00:28:58.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair.

asr-000652
00:28:59.060 --> 00:29:00.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May I proceed with my questions?

asr-000653
00:29:02.140 --> 00:29:08.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: May we just ask the, you know, in every question, kung ayaw naman nilang sagutin, pwede naman nilang hindi sagutin.

asr-000654
00:29:09.080 --> 00:29:13.300
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Para makita nila yung depression ng office of the President na ayaw sumagot,

asr-000655
00:29:13.460 --> 00:29:16.700
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: at yung office of the Vice President na gusto sumagot.

asr-000656
00:29:16.920 --> 00:29:17.620
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Tama nga naman.

asr-000657
00:29:17.780 --> 00:29:22.240
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: But if the question is irrelevant to today's proceedings, I will roll against it.

asr-000658
00:29:22.240 --> 00:29:23.840
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: They can simply say that it's irrelevant.

asr-000659
00:29:24.280 --> 00:29:25.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: I will rule against it.

asr-000660
00:29:26.040 --> 00:29:26.820
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Okay? Cong Tinio.

asr-000661
00:29:26.820 --> 00:29:27.760
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: You have the floor.

asr-000662
00:29:29.060 --> 00:29:32.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair, no question is irrelevant in budget proceedings.

asr-000663
00:29:32.700 --> 00:29:33.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun po ang posisyon natin.

asr-000664
00:29:33.820 --> 00:29:37.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But anyway, let me proceed with my question.

asr-000665
00:29:39.960 --> 00:29:42.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It so happens, my questions are related to the budget.

asr-000666
00:29:43.440 --> 00:29:43.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000667
00:29:45.780 --> 00:29:56.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, Mr. Chair, yung office of the Vice President, kakaiba, dahil nga, essentially, meron siyang, yung MOE ng office of the Vice President,

asr-000668
00:29:56.980 --> 00:29:59.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang pinaka-bulto nito ay

asr-000669
00:29:59.840 --> 00:30:02.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: para sa mga

asr-000670
00:30:02.200 --> 00:30:05.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: discretionary programs ng Vice President.

asr-000672
00:30:06.580 --> 00:30:11.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And this has been true of the office, hindi lang ngayon, kung hindi kahit toon pa.

asr-000673
00:30:13.520 --> 00:30:20.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Historically, ang natatandaan ko, talagang nangyari yan noong panahon ni Vice President Binay

asr-000674
00:30:20.540 --> 00:30:23.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: under the Aquino administration because it was that time,

asr-000675
00:30:23.800 --> 00:30:34.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: he used to be senator, tapos yung pork barrel niya noon, may pidaf pa noon,

asr-000676
00:30:34.600 --> 00:30:39.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nung naging Vice President siya, yung allocation nilipat sa Office of the Vice President.

asr-000677
00:30:41.500 --> 00:30:47.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya ganun lumaki ang pondo ng Office of the Vice President.

asr-000678
00:30:48.340 --> 00:30:52.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nagkaroon ng malaking MOE para sa mga programa.

asr-000679
00:30:53.820 --> 00:30:55.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now, kakaiba ito.

asr-000680
00:30:55.400 --> 00:30:59.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, dahil discretionary nga yung mga program, kung anong maisip ng Vice Presidente,

asr-000681
00:31:00.240 --> 00:31:01.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yun ang ipatutupad.

asr-000682
00:31:01.380 --> 00:31:07.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Totoo yan, noong panahon ni VP Binay, ni Robredo, at ngayon ni Duterte.

asr-000683
00:31:08.240 --> 00:31:12.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ngayon, merong mga programa ito.

asr-000684
00:31:12.600 --> 00:31:16.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At ang tanong ko niyan, kasi ang kaibahan, usually, pag may mga ayuda programs,

asr-000685
00:31:16.940 --> 00:31:24.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang nag-implement, DSWD or DOH, but in the case of the Office of the Vice President,

asr-000686
00:31:24.900 --> 00:31:28.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: direct ang nag-implement yung opisina mismo.

asr-000687
00:31:29.240 --> 00:31:32.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, of course, ang importante dito ay guidelines.

asr-000688
00:31:32.760 --> 00:31:36.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang tanong lang po natin, meron po bang malinaw na guidelines

asr-000689
00:31:36.600 --> 00:31:45.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang bawat programa rito, yung mga mag-negosyo taday, wheelchair distribution,

asr-000690
00:31:45.860 --> 00:31:47.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pagbabago campaign, and so on and so forth.

asr-000691
00:31:48.880 --> 00:31:51.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At accessible po ba ito sa publiko?

asr-000692
00:31:51.640 --> 00:31:54.640
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: So, for the record, Your Honor, yes.

asr-000693
00:31:54.900 --> 00:31:58.840
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: All our programs, all the nine core programs of the Office of the Vice President

asr-000694
00:31:58.840 --> 00:32:02.080
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: are covered by manuals of operation.

asr-000695
00:32:02.780 --> 00:32:08.960
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Several manuals of operation that is regularly updated in consultation with the Commission on Audit

asr-000696
00:32:08.960 --> 00:32:14.000
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: to further improve process requirements, Your Honor.

asr-000697
00:32:15.860 --> 00:32:21.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kineko po yung, of course, may manual kayo, kailangan din available sa publiko.

asr-000698
00:32:21.200 --> 00:32:24.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, for the most part, sa website, nandun yung manual.

asr-000699
00:32:24.900 --> 00:32:25.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May mga requirements, di ba?

asr-000700
00:32:26.040 --> 00:32:27.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May mga ilan lang na hindi.

asr-000701
00:32:27.300 --> 00:32:32.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For example, yung You Can Be VP, wala pong detalya dito.

asr-000702
00:32:32.280 --> 00:32:36.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And I noticed in the budget, 1.1 million ang proposed budget,

asr-000703
00:32:37.260 --> 00:32:39.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tapos yung target beneficiaries, dalawa lang.

asr-000704
00:32:40.160 --> 00:32:44.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, parang ang dating niyan, tigpa 500,000 plus.

asr-000705
00:32:44.880 --> 00:32:46.100
Deputy Speaker Jose C. Alvarez: Yung You Can Be VP.

asr-000706
00:32:46.760 --> 00:32:47.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano ba yun?

asr-000707
00:32:47.440 --> 00:32:54.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At ganun ba talaga kalaki ang grant na ibibigay ng office, kalahating milyon?

asr-000708
00:32:54.900 --> 00:32:56.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para sa dalawang beneficiary?

asr-000709
00:32:56.720 --> 00:32:57.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tornes Olaiga.

asr-000710
00:32:57.680 --> 00:32:58.660
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000711
00:32:59.240 --> 00:33:01.660
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: So, just to add to the earlier question,

asr-000712
00:33:02.060 --> 00:33:07.280
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: some of our manuals of operation or the procedure is actually found in our citizens charter.

asr-000713
00:33:07.680 --> 00:33:12.700
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: But you're right, the You Can Be VP is not included in the citizens charter.

asr-000714
00:33:12.880 --> 00:33:21.060
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Siguro for more detailed process as regards the You Can Be VP program,

asr-000715
00:33:21.180 --> 00:33:24.640
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: we can have our Director for Operations, Director Baloro, discuss it further.

asr-000716
00:33:24.640 --> 00:33:25.480
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Go ahead, Norman.

asr-000717
00:33:25.480 --> 00:33:25.980
Director Norman Valora: Thank you, Yusek.

asr-000718
00:33:26.260 --> 00:33:30.220
Director Norman Valora: Mr. Chair, for enlightenment, Mr. Chair,

asr-000719
00:33:30.660 --> 00:33:38.440
Director Norman Valora: the two You Can Be VP program are those learners that can be part of the engagements,

asr-000720
00:33:38.820 --> 00:33:41.640
Director Norman Valora: both local or international with the Vice President.

asr-000721
00:33:41.820 --> 00:33:47.720
Director Norman Valora: But however, this is not just only limited with the exposure of these particular learners,

asr-000722
00:33:47.880 --> 00:33:50.260
Director Norman Valora: but we are also doing with the Junior Leadership Program.

asr-000723
00:33:51.060 --> 00:33:54.580
Director Norman Valora: Recently, Your Honor, we already have five.

asr-000724
00:33:55.480 --> 00:34:00.660
Director Norman Valora: So, what we are doing right now is we are giving them the skills development

asr-000725
00:34:00.660 --> 00:34:05.020
Director Norman Valora: just to ensure that they can also coach or mentor other young learners

asr-000726
00:34:05.020 --> 00:34:08.160
Director Norman Valora: to be also a good leader in the country, Your Honor.

asr-000727
00:34:10.430 --> 00:34:18.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Why is the grant apparently 550,000 per learner or individual?

asr-000728
00:34:19.140 --> 00:34:23.460
Director Norman Valora: Your Honor, this is not only limited for, like, for example,

asr-000729
00:34:23.560 --> 00:34:26.380
Director Norman Valora: the 500,000 is to be given to the recipient, Your Honor.

asr-000730
00:34:26.380 --> 00:34:27.380
Director Norman Valora: This is to be used.

asr-000731
00:34:27.520 --> 00:34:29.620
Director Norman Valora: This is to be used with the other activities to be conducted

asr-000732
00:34:29.620 --> 00:34:32.180
Director Norman Valora: in line with the You Can Be VP program, Your Honor.

asr-000733
00:34:33.700 --> 00:34:34.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000734
00:34:34.200 --> 00:34:36.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi, well, baka kailangang ilinaw niyo.

asr-000735
00:34:36.580 --> 00:34:39.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi ang sabi rito, number of beneficiaries, two learners.

asr-000736
00:34:40.900 --> 00:34:43.560
Director Norman Valora: So, that's just only the target, Your Honor,

asr-000737
00:34:43.720 --> 00:34:47.680
Director Norman Valora: that we can identify, Your Honor, as an eligible learner

asr-000738
00:34:47.680 --> 00:34:52.980
Director Norman Valora: that can also be exposed with the local and international engagement

asr-000739
00:34:52.980 --> 00:34:54.740
Director Norman Valora: with the Vice President, Your Honor.

asr-000740
00:34:54.740 --> 00:34:57.500
Director Norman Valora: But however, we also have other activities,

asr-000741
00:34:57.520 --> 00:35:01.340
Director Norman Valora: Your Honor, with regard to mentoring and enhancing the skills,

asr-000742
00:35:01.540 --> 00:35:03.960
Director Norman Valora: the knowledge, and the attitudes of these learners, Your Honor.

asr-000743
00:35:04.200 --> 00:35:04.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-000744
00:35:06.200 --> 00:35:09.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang, sa, in terms of number of beneficiaries niyo,

asr-000745
00:35:10.160 --> 00:35:11.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sabi niyo, 1.4 million.

asr-000746
00:35:11.760 --> 00:35:14.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero ang bulto talaga nito ay dun sa Libreng Sakay.

asr-000747
00:35:14.400 --> 00:35:18.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 1.2 million of the 1.4 million beneficiaries

asr-000748
00:35:18.200 --> 00:35:20.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: are with the Libreng Sakay program.

asr-000749
00:35:21.400 --> 00:35:25.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero ang budget niya, hindi naman yung pinakamalaki, 22 million.

asr-000750
00:35:25.700 --> 00:35:26.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, could you,

asr-000751
00:35:27.520 --> 00:35:29.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: clarify lang, para mas malinaw,

asr-000752
00:35:29.560 --> 00:35:30.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ilang sasakyan po ba

asr-000753
00:35:30.720 --> 00:35:34.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang involved sa Libreng Sakay program?

asr-000754
00:35:35.460 --> 00:35:37.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At paano yung arrangement dito?

asr-000755
00:35:37.960 --> 00:35:39.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Service contracting ba ito?

asr-000756
00:35:40.400 --> 00:35:42.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bumili ba kayo ng sariling sasakyan?

asr-000757
00:35:43.140 --> 00:35:44.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Please explain.

asr-000758
00:35:44.780 --> 00:35:45.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Please explain, Attorney.

asr-000759
00:35:45.960 --> 00:35:46.800
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Alright, thank you.

asr-000760
00:35:47.400 --> 00:35:48.960
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Thank you, Sir.

asr-000761
00:35:49.460 --> 00:35:54.480
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Alright, currently, the Libreng Sakay program has nine buses across the country.

asr-000762
00:35:55.320 --> 00:35:57.280
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Four are flying in Metro Manila,

asr-000763
00:35:57.520 --> 00:36:03.220
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: two, one for Cavite, P-TEX, correct, no?

asr-000764
00:36:03.300 --> 00:36:07.020
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: And then we have for Quiapo to Commonwealth, dalawa.

asr-000765
00:36:07.460 --> 00:36:10.120
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: And then also, also for the EDSA carousel.

asr-000766
00:36:10.580 --> 00:36:13.120
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: And then we also have buses for Tacloban,

asr-000767
00:36:13.640 --> 00:36:15.440
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Bacolod, the city of Bacolod,

asr-000768
00:36:16.000 --> 00:36:19.520
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Davao City, Cebu, and...

asr-000769
00:36:21.260 --> 00:36:23.380
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Yun lang. So, nine na pala.

asr-000770
00:36:23.380 --> 00:36:25.680
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Wala sa Palawan at saka sa Nueva Ecija.

asr-000771
00:36:25.780 --> 00:36:26.820
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Yes, we heard you, Sir.

asr-000772
00:36:27.520 --> 00:36:30.900
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: So, sa kabuuan, nationwide, nine na sasakyan.

asr-000773
00:36:31.000 --> 00:36:31.620
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: That is true.

asr-000774
00:36:31.920 --> 00:36:33.020
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Nine buses, yes.

asr-000775
00:36:33.160 --> 00:36:35.240
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: This is a partnership, if I may add also,

asr-000776
00:36:35.380 --> 00:36:38.640
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: to also recognize our partners for the Libreng Sakay.

asr-000777
00:36:39.060 --> 00:36:42.720
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: We are working with the LTFRB and also with the MMDA.

asr-000778
00:36:43.160 --> 00:36:45.480
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: They are the ones, and also, of course, the OTR,

asr-000779
00:36:45.920 --> 00:36:48.780
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: they're the ones who plan the routes for the buses

asr-000780
00:36:48.780 --> 00:36:53.440
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: because that is not an expertise of the Office of the Vice President.

asr-000781
00:36:53.440 --> 00:36:53.500
Undersecretary Zuleika T. Lopez: Okay.

